742
00:48:06,260 --> 00:48:09,160
It was easy to refuel a car with gasoline.

743
00:48:09,400 --> 00:48:10,400
It was fairly quick.

744
00:48:10,860 --> 00:48:12,020
Gasoline was very efficient.

745
00:48:13,080 --> 00:48:23,200
The gasoline-powered automobile seemed to better reflect the new social realities the horseless carriage was ushering in.

746
00:48:23,960 --> 00:48:28,920
The gas car had greater range and speed that could provide more mobility and freedom.

747
00:48:29,880 --> 00:48:34,880
The decision to make gasoline the fuel of choice was also aided by a major discovery

748
00:48:34,881 --> 00:48:37,980
