00:51:16,635 --> 00:51:20,620
They're very inefficient in stop-and-start city driving, whereas electric

794
00:51:20,621 --> 00:51:26,580
motors are very efficient in stop-and-start city driving and not efficient at high-speed freeway

795
00:51:26,581 --> 00:51:27,281
driving.

796
00:51:27,600 --> 00:51:33,700
The Prius utilizes technology, which is a breakthrough, because it actually, in a synergistic way,

797
00:51:33,880 --> 00:51:37,620
combines the best of an internal combustion engine and an electric drive.

798
00:51:37,640 --> 00:51:38,340
system.

799
00:51:38,341 --> 00:51:42,800
The internal combustion engine allows you to use the infrastructure that exists today.

800
00:51:43,220 --> 00:51:47,780
The gas stations that are there, current gasoline, emission control rules that exist right now.

801
00:51:48,480 --> 00:51:56,100
The electrical components that go with that extend beyond what the IC engine can do and gives us a whole new world.

802
00:51:56,640 --> 00:52:00,460
The gas motor is recharging the batteries to run the electric motor the next time you need it.

