00:55:46,661 --> 00:55:50,660
what makes it so special it has most advanced power train in the world.

863
00:55:50,661 --> 00:55:53,660
It's called a fuel cell.

864
00:55:53,661 --> 00:55:56,660
It's an electric car that runs on hydrogen.

865
00:55:56,661 --> 00:56:00,660
This is the kind of engine that may be under your hood in 20 years.

866
00:56:00,661 --> 00:56:03,660
A fuel cell car is really an electric car.

