884
00:57:18,280 --> 00:57:20,980
He figured that the opposite could also be true.

885
00:57:21,520 --> 00:57:24,700
His gas battery worked and was later renamed the fuel cell.

886
00:57:26,640 --> 00:57:27,820
For more than a sense,

887
00:57:27,840 --> 00:57:34,840
Many others worked on the concept, but it wasn't until the 1960s that fuel cell technology literally took off.

888
00:57:34,841 --> 00:57:39,840
NASA needed a compact way to generate electricity for space missions.

889
00:57:39,841 --> 00:57:42,840
Nuclear power was too dangerous.

890
00:57:42,841 --> 00:57:45,840
Batteries were too heavy, and solar was too cumbersome.

891
00:57:45,841 --> 00:57:48,840
The fuel cell was the choice.

892
00:57:48,841 --> 00:57:52,840
Besides, its waste product could be drinking water for the astronauts.

